    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="070ced4e-da18-5404-9f16-656b849641b6" activityNameId="a8c6821a-a68a-5e41-b88f-47288da0c54e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Methanol, from biomass, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Methanol, from biomass, at regional storage
Bottom-Up estimation based on plant data. Life time is 80 years. Product storage volume of storage tanks is 10'000 m3. The average storage time is 2 months. Thus total through flow in the life time is 4.8 mio. m3.;
CAS number: 000067-56-1; 
Formula: CH3OH; 
Synonyms: methyl alcohol, methyl hydroxide, monohydroxymethane; 
UUID: 86dbfed6-a17c-30a1-9ebf-7b9f07e8f8b6
This process includes the transport of biomass-based methanol from the plant to the end user. Operation of storage tanks and fuel station. Emissions from evaporation and treatment of effluents.
Location: Surveys mainly for DE and CH.
Technology: Distribution of fuels
Time period: undefined
Production volume: No commercial production of methanol-from-biomass. Laboratory-to-pilot scale.
Sampling: Environmental reports and literature. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_86dbfed6-a17c-30a1-9ebf-7b9f07e8f8b6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
